---
name: Groundedness check
description: Checks that every claim in an answer is supported by the cited passages.
model:
  api: chat
  parameters:
    temperature: 0
    max_tokens: 60
sample:
  answer: Employees get 24 days of leave [1].
  passages:
    - number: 1
      text: Full-time employees receive 24 days of paid annual leave per calendar year.
---
system:
You check answers for hallucinations. Reply with JSON only: {"grounded": true} if every statement in the answer is
supported by the passages, otherwise {"grounded": false}.

user:
Passages:
{% for p in passages %}
[{{ p.number }}] {{ p.text }}
{% endfor %}

Answer:
{{ answer }}
